<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5@2.3.2/lib/p5.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5.sound@0.4.1/dist/p5.sound.min.js"></script>

    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="style.css">
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Manhattan Beach</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <button class="menu-btn" aria-label="Menu">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
      <div class="search-wrap">
        <input type="text" class="search-input" placeholder="Search">
        <span class="search-icon">&#128269;</span>
      </div>
      <div class="profile-icon" aria-label="Profile">&#128100;</div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="title-row">
        <span class="pin-icon">&#128205;</span>
        <h1 class="title">Manhattan</h1>
      </div>

      <p class="address">Oriental Blvd. between Ocean Ave. and Mackenzie St.</p>

      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="info-box">
          <p>
            This beach on Brooklyn's southern tip is a popular summertime
            destination for people from all over New York City. As the
            weather heats up, families pack picnic baskets and come out to
            barbeque, loll on the sand, and swim in the waves. Bookended by
            playgrounds, and with two large baseball diamonds on its eastern
            border, as well as tennis, volleyball, basketball, and handball,
            this park has plenty of room for all types of active outdoor
            recreation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="side-col">
          <div class="image-box">
            <img
              src="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0c/c1/a5/4a/from-street-look-at-the.jpg?w=1200&h=1200&s=1"
              alt="Street view of the entrance to Manhattan Beach"
            >
          </div>

          <div class="graph-box">
            <canvas id="graphCanvas" width="300" height="180"></canvas>
            <p class="graph-label">graph</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script src="sketch.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
